      <article class="blog-card">
        <p class="post-date">March 2025</p>
        <h2><a href="#interpretable-deep-learning">Building Interpretable Deep Learning Models for Neuroscience</a></h2>
        <p>Notes on translating model explanations into hypotheses neuroscientists can test experimentally.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="blog-card">
        <p class="post-date">January 2025</p>
        <h2><a href="#ml-single-cell-genomics">Bridging Machine Learning and Single-Cell Genomics</a></h2>
